    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/phlm#Phlm.1.1",
      "source_sha256": "19067ecebe12c56b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "Paul, a prisoner of Christ Jesus, and Timothy, our brother, writing to Philemon, the beloved and our fellow worker,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/phlm#Phlm.1.2",
      "source_sha256": "cba2496ca7ddd46a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "and to Apphia, the beloved, and Archippus, our fellow soldier, and the congregation in your house."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/phlm#Phlm.1.3",
      "source_sha256": "e1575658deced0ec",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 3,
      "text": "Grace and peace to you from God our Father and the Lord Jesus Christ."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/phlm#Phlm.1.4",
      "source_sha256": "e3673d619643f7c2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "I always give thanks to [?] my God, remembering you in my prayers,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/phlm#Phlm.1.5",
      "source_sha256": "bfad5f4bcf0cf37c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "because I hear about your faith and your love toward the Lord Jesus and toward all the holy ones,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/phlm#Phlm.1.6",
      "source_sha256": "efe0d754769ed804",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "so that the sharing of your faith may become effective through the knowledge of every good thing that is in you for Christ."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/phlm#Phlm.1.7",
      "source_sha256": "4c051f3b48700c92",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "For I have had great joy and comfort because of your love, since the hearts of the holy ones have been refreshed through you, brother."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/phlm#Phlm.1.8",
      "source_sha256": "09095d36fbee7540",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 2,
      "text": "For this reason, although I have great boldness in Christ to command you to do what is right,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/phlm#Phlm.1.9",
      "source_sha256": "2779ffcc3d22e066",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "For love’s sake, I appeal instead, being who I am—Paul, older than you, and now also a prisoner in Christ Jesus."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/phlm#Phlm.1.10",
      "source_sha256": "6898d86944a84df9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "I appeal to you for my child Onesimus, whom I fathered while in chains."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/phlm#Phlm.1.11",
      "source_sha256": "80821c370f20c3dd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "He was formerly useless to you, but now he is useful both to you and to me. I have sent him to you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/phlm#Phlm.1.12",
      "source_sha256": "6546263a39865358",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "Receive him, for he is my own heart."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/phlm#Phlm.1.13",
      "source_sha256": "c38f0afa50c4ebc0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "I wanted to keep him with me so that he could serve me in your place while I am in chains for the good news."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/phlm#Phlm.1.14",
      "source_sha256": "2385352902bcc22b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "But I did not want to do anything without your consent, so that your good deed would not be forced but voluntary."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/phlm#Phlm.1.15",
      "source_sha256": "cc6a20702af295f3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "For perhaps he was separated from you for a short time for this reason: so that you might have him forever,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/phlm#Phlm.1.16",
      "source_sha256": "e61dd1ec57547428",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "no longer as a slave, but as more than a slave—a beloved brother, especially to me, but how much more to you, both in the flesh and in the Lord."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/phlm#Phlm.1.17",
      "source_sha256": "05a9ff5a7a5a12f8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "So if you consider me a partner, receive him as you would me."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/phlm#Phlm.1.18",
      "source_sha256": "13891418bde95bbe",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "If he has wronged you in anything or owes you anything, charge that to me."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/phlm#Phlm.1.19",
      "source_sha256": "b30937281f4110e7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "I, Paul, have written this with my own hand: I will repay you—not to mention that you yourself owe me a debt of gratitude."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/phlm#Phlm.1.20",
      "source_sha256": "3f8f279de95861d2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 2,
      "text": "Yes, brother, let me find comfort through you in the Lord. Refresh my heart in Christ."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/phlm#Phlm.1.21",
      "source_sha256": "ee3b1266e58d9cdc",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "Confident of your obedience, I have written to you, knowing that you will do more than I say."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/phlm#Phlm.1.22",
      "source_sha256": "4561250b34d103ac",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "At the same time, prepare a place for me to stay, for I hope that through your prayers I will be graciously given back to you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/phlm#Phlm.1.23",
      "source_sha256": "28fa07a5e6d800ae",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "Epaphras, my fellow prisoner in Christ Jesus, greets you,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/phlm#Phlm.1.24",
      "source_sha256": "4b99d04c1086d03a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "as do Mark, Aristarchus, Demas, and Luke, my fellow workers."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/phlm#Phlm.1.25",
      "source_sha256": "db2149508f585a0d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "The grace of our Lord Jesus Christ be with your spirit."
    }
  ]
}
